# Perimeter Enforcer: "... and whenever a Detective you control is turned face up, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn"
# (CR 701.58b, 708.8). Cryptic Coat cloaks Novice Inspector from the top of Bot1's library: a face-down 2/2 is no Detective, and
# entering face down it triggers nothing (the Enforcer is still 1/1). On turn 3 Bot1 turns it face up for its mana cost {W}
# (Mox Pearl): a Detective turned up under Bot1's control, so the Enforcer gets +1/+1 and is 2/2. Turning up is not entering, so
# Novice Inspector does not investigate.

